u='s2-u27'
write(u,'去过不等于下次也会',['Describe a past experience with 过','Separate an itinerary from a completed experience','Ask what has been confirmed without relying on an old trip'],[
('过','past-experience marker','trợ từ trải nghiệm','particle','我去过那里，但不是今年去的。','I have been there, but not this year.'),('会','meeting; gathering','cuộc họp','noun','这个会下午两点开始。','This meeting starts at two in the afternoon.'),('机会','opportunity','cơ hội','noun','有机会我想再去。','If there is an opportunity, I would like to go again.'),('参观','to visit for viewing or learning','tham quan','verb','我们参观过那个博物馆。','We have visited that museum.'),('出国','to go abroad','ra nước ngoài','verb','前年我出国学习。','I went abroad to study the year before last.'),('回国','to return to one’s country','về nước','verb','去年回国以后，我继续学汉语。','After returning to my country last year, I continued studying Mandarin.'),('旅行','to travel; journey','du lịch; chuyến đi','verb','这次旅行还没有定日期。','This trip’s dates have not yet been fixed.'),('旅游','to travel for leisure; tourism','du lịch','verb','周末旅游，先确认地方。','For a leisure trip this weekend, first confirm the destination.'),('游客','visitor; tourist','du khách','noun','游客先看入口的通知。','Visitors read the notice at the entrance first.'),('旅客','traveller; passenger','hành khách','noun','旅客在车站等车。','Passengers wait for the vehicle at the station.'),('护照','passport','hộ chiếu','noun','护照用于旅行，不是普通会员卡。','A passport is used for travel, not as an ordinary membership card.'),('国际','international','quốc tế','adjective','这是国际活动，日期还没确认。','This is an international event; the date is not confirmed yet.'),('前年','the year before last','năm kia','noun','前年去过，不是说今年已经去。','Having been the year before last does not mean having already gone this year.'),('起飞','to take off','cất cánh','verb','航班还没有起飞。','The flight has not taken off yet.'),('船','boat; ship','thuyền; tàu','noun','船还没开，先看通知。','The boat has not departed yet; first check the notice.'),('骑','to ride astride','cưỡi; đạp','verb','我不会骑这辆车，不能直接出发。','I do not know how to ride this bicycle, so I cannot just set off.'),('骑车','to ride a bicycle or motorbike','đi xe đạp hoặc xe máy','verb','骑车以前先确认路。','Check the route before riding.'),('自行车','bicycle','xe đạp','noun','这辆自行车是借的。','This bicycle is borrowed.'),('外地','another locality; out of town','nơi khác; ngoại tỉnh','noun','朋友从外地来，先确认到站时间。','My friend is coming from out of town; first confirm the arrival time.'),('平安','safe and sound','bình an','adjective','到了以后说一声平安。','Let us know you are safe once you arrive.'),('一路平安','have a safe journey','thượng lộ bình an','phrase','朋友出发前，我说一路平安。','Before my friend leaves, I say Have a safe journey.'),('一路顺风','have a smooth journey','chúc chuyến đi thuận lợi','phrase','一路顺风，到了给我消息。','Have a smooth journey; message me once you arrive.')],
[grammar(u,'二32','过：经历标记','Report experience without claiming a current event',
'去过 means having had the experience. 没去过 denies experience; 不去 is refusal or a plan not to go. 去过 does not specify when, so add 前年 when relevant. 不要 infer that a museum is open now from having visited it before. The particle is neutral guo, unlike full-tone guò in passing by.',[
('我去过，但不是今年。','I have been, but not this year.'),('我没去过那个地方。','I have never been to that place.'),('前年我参观过那里。','I visited it the year before last.')],('我不去过。意思是没有这个经历。','我没去过。','Negate past experience with 没.')),
grammar(u,'二71','动词 + 过：曾经发生的经历','Separate experience, plans and current confirmation',
'我坐过船 but 今天船还没开 separates a past experience from today’s departure. 我想参观 is a desire, not a completed visit. 我去年去的 answers the time of an established event; 我去过 answers whether the experience exists. A trip can have occurred without establishing present conditions or expertise.',[
('我坐过船，今天还要看发船时间。','I have taken a boat before; today I still need to check its departure time.'),('她想参观，还没有参观过。','She wants to visit and has not visited before.'),('这辆车我没骑过，先问怎么骑。','I have never ridden this bicycle; first ask how to ride it.')],('我去过，所以今天一定开门。','我去过，但今天开不开要确认。','A past visit cannot confirm today’s opening.'))],
text(u,'d','A trip is not a timetable','Find which facts are experience and which remain unconfirmed.',[
('你去过那个博物馆吗？','Have you been to that museum?'),('去过，前年出国的时候参观过。','Yes; I visited it when I went abroad the year before last.'),('那星期六一定开门吧？','Then it must be open on Saturday, right?'),('不一定。过去的经历不是今天的通知。','Not necessarily. Past experience is not today’s notice.'),('这次国际活动的会几点开始？','What time does the meeting for this international event start?'),('会是两点，旅行日期还没确认。','The meeting is at two; the trip date is not yet confirmed.'),('我没坐过船，可以直接选船吗？','I have never taken a boat; can I just choose it?'),('先看行程和发船时间，再选择。','Check the itinerary and boat departure time first, then choose.')],
[('mainidea','What must still be checked?',['Current opening and travel details','Whether the old visit ever occurred','Whether two means three'],0),('detail','When was the museum visit?',['The year before last','This Saturday','This morning'],0),('inference','Does a past visit establish Saturday opening?',['No','Yes','Only after flying'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','What I have actually done','Read an experience note without turning it into current travel guidance.',[
('前年我出国学习，也参观过博物馆。','The year before last, I went abroad to study and visited a museum.'),('去年回国以后，我在家继续学习。','After returning to my country last year, I continued studying at home.'),('我坐过船，也骑过自行车。','I have taken a boat and ridden a bicycle.'),('没有看过那里的鱼，也没有爬过那座山。','I have not seen the fish there or climbed that mountain.'),('这些是经历，不是这次旅行的安排。','These are experiences, not arrangements for this trip.'),('护照用于旅行，证件要求需要看正式通知。','A passport is used for travel; document requirements must be checked in the formal notice.'),('游客和旅客都要确认时间，不能只看以前的照片。','Visitors and passengers need to confirm times, rather than rely only on old photos.'),('外地朋友来看我，我说一路平安，到了再发消息。','A friend comes from out of town to visit; I wish a safe journey and ask for a message after arrival.')],
[('mainidea','What does the note distinguish?',['Past experiences from present plans','The sea from every lake','All visitors from all friends'],0),('detail','Which activity has not been done?',['Climbing that mountain','Riding a bicycle','Visiting the museum'],0),('inference','Where should current document requirements come from?',['Formal current information','The old photograph alone','An invented rule'],0)],[(0,'前年'),(4,'经历')]),
text(u,'media','The experienced postcard','Read an original scene about relying too much on old pictures.',[
('照片里你坐过船，所以今天不用查了？','You took a boat in the photo, so no need to check today?'),('我坐过，不是每天都坐。','I have taken one, not every day.'),('那你参观过，也不是永远开门。','Then having visited does not mean it stays open forever either.'),('终于懂了。先看通知。','At last, understood. Check the notice first.'),('一路顺风，到了告诉我。','Have a smooth journey; tell me after arrival.'),('好。祝福不是时刻表。','Okay. A good wish is not a timetable.')],
[('inference','What does the final joke limit?',['A travel wish cannot supply a schedule','The friend must not travel','No notice is needed'],0)],drama=True),
dict(tf=[('过','我前年去过，今年还没去。','I went the year before last and have not gone this year.','The speaker has already gone this year.',False,'今年还没去 denies it.'),('参观','我想参观，还没有参观过。','I want to visit and have not visited before.','The visit is only desired so far.',True,'想 and 没有 contrast desire and experience.')],reply=[('护照','这次旅行要什么证件？','What documents does this trip need?',['先看正式通知，再确认。','照片里肯定都一样。','一路顺风就是护照。'],0,'Check actual requirements.'),('会','这个会几点开始？','When does this meeting begin?',['下午两点。','我会游泳。','去过，所以不用问。'],0,'会 is a meeting noun in this question.')],fill=[('前年','前年我参观过那里。','I visited there the year before last.'),('平安','到了以后说一声平安。','Let us know you are safe after arriving.')],match=[('旅客',[('旅客在车站等车。','Passengers wait at the station.'),('游客看入口通知。','Visitors read the entrance notice.'),('航班还没起飞。','The flight has not taken off.')]),('经历',[('我坐过船。','I have taken a boat before.'),('我想坐船。','I would like to take a boat.'),('今天船还没开。','The boat has not departed today.')])]),
[('A past experience','去过，不过今天还要确认。','I have been, but we still need to check today.','Do not infer current conditions from history.'),('A travel wish','一路平安，到了发消息。','Have a safe journey; message after arriving.','A good wish is not a guarantee.')],
[('去过吗？','Have you been?','Report experience without a present guarantee',['去过，今天还要确认。']),('我想坐船。','I want to take a boat.','Ask for current details',['先看发船时间吧。'])],
'Native check: guo experience particle versus guò motion readings, 会 meeting noun, 骑车 scope, 于 within 用于, passenger/visitor register and postcard joke. Document/transport lines teach verification, not live travel or immigration advice.')

u='s2-u28'
write(u,'进来坐门开着',['Describe a continuing state with 着','Locate an object with an existential sentence','Distinguish an available room from a completed rental agreement'],[
('住房','housing; dwelling','nhà ở','noun','这是住房信息，不是已经租好的房子。','This is housing information, not a home already rented.'),('租','to rent; lease','thuê','verb','想租以前先问条件。','Ask about the conditions before renting.'),('出租','to rent out','cho thuê','verb','这间房出租，但还要确认时间。','This room is for rent, but the time still needs confirmation.'),('出租车','taxi','taxi','noun','朋友坐出租车来看房。','My friend takes a taxi to view the room.'),('酒店','hotel','khách sạn','noun','酒店是这次暂时住的地方。','The hotel is temporary accommodation for this visit.'),('店','shop; store','cửa hàng','noun','店里买东西，不是看这间房。','You buy things in the shop, rather than view this room there.'),('大衣','overcoat','áo khoác dài','noun','大衣挂着，别放在地上。','The overcoat is hanging; do not put it on the floor.'),('大小','size','kích thước','noun','房间的大小要实际看。','The size of the room needs to be seen in person.'),('椅子','chair','ghế','noun','门边有两把椅子。','There are two chairs by the door.'),('洗衣机','washing machine','máy giặt','noun','洗衣机可以用，但先问怎么用。','The washing machine may be used, but first ask how.'),('洗澡','to bathe; take a shower','tắm','verb','洗澡前先问热水什么时候有。','Before showering, ask when hot water is available.'),('脏','dirty','bẩn','adjective','这个杯垫有点脏，先洗一下。','This coaster is a little dirty; wash it first.'),('装','to pack; put into; install','xếp vào; lắp','verb','把书装进包，不装湿衣服。','Put the books in the bag, not wet clothes.'),('留','to stay; retain','ở lại; giữ','verb','可以留一会儿，不是今天就搬进来。','You may stay a while; that does not mean move in today.'),('留下','to leave behind; stay','để lại; ở lại','verb','把联系方式留下，明天再说。','Leave your contact details; we can discuss tomorrow.'),('里头','inside','bên trong','noun','里头有桌子，先进去看看。','There is a table inside; first go in and look.'),('头','neutral suffix in location words','hậu tố chỉ vị trí','suffix','里头的头是轻声，不单独读成头发的头。','The suffix in 里头 is neutral; it is not read independently as the full-tone 头 in hair.'),('面','face; surface; side','mặt; bề mặt','noun','桌子的面很平，没有放书。','The table’s surface is flat and has no books on it.'),('面前','in front of; before','trước mặt','noun','面前有桌子，别挡着门。','There is a table in front of you; do not block the door.'),('有人','someone; there are people','có người','phrase','屋里有人，先敲门。','There is someone in the room; knock first.'),('院','courtyard; institute','sân; viện','noun','院里有树，不是房间里。','There are trees in the courtyard, not inside the room.'),('院子','courtyard','sân','noun','院子门开着，但先问能不能进。','The courtyard gate is open, but first ask whether you may enter.')],
[grammar(u,'二33','着：持续状态或动作标记','Describe a state that remains',
'门开着 states that the door is open; 开了门 reports opening it. 他拿着书 describes holding the book, not whether he is reading it. 着 is neutral zhe here. Open doors do not establish permission, and a continuing position does not prove a completed agreement.',[
('门开着，先敲门吧。','The door is open; knock first.'),('她拿着书，站在门边。','She is holding a book and standing by the door.'),('大衣挂着，没有放在地上。','The overcoat is hanging, not on the floor.')],('门开着了，我是在说现在的状态。','门开着。','For this plain state description use 着; do not add 了 without a change-of-state context.')),
grammar(u,'二56','处所 + 是 / 有 / 动词着：存现','Locate what exists in a place',
'门边有椅子 introduces chairs at the door. 门边是洗手间 identifies what that location is. 桌上放着书 describes books positioned on the table. The place comes first in these existential descriptions. Compare 椅子在门边, which locates an already mentioned chair. Keep introduction and identification distinct.',[
('门边有两把椅子。','There are two chairs by the door.'),('门边是洗手间。','The place beside the door is the bathroom.'),('桌上放着一本书。','A book is lying on the table.')],('门边在两把椅子。','门边有两把椅子。','Introduce the chairs at a location with 有.')),
grammar(u,'二70','动词 + 着：持续；伴随状态','Read a state accompanying another action',
'拿着书说话 describes talking while holding a book. The holding accompanies the speaking and does not imply reading. 门开着 is a continuing state; 开门了 is an event or change. Do not infer consent to enter from the physical state, or infer a signed rental from viewing a room.',[
('她拿着书介绍房间。','She introduces the room while holding a book.'),('我站着等，没有坐下。','I wait standing and have not sat down.'),('桌上放着杯子，朋友在旁边说话。','A cup sits on the table and the friend is talking nearby.')],('她拿着书，所以一定正在读。','她拿着书，但现在在说话。','Holding a book does not establish that reading is occurring.'))],
text(u,'d','An open door','Find what is available and what has not been agreed.',[
('院子门开着，我可以直接进去吗？','The courtyard gate is open; may I just enter?'),('先敲门问一声，里头有人。','Knock and ask first; there is someone inside.'),('你好，我们来看出租的房间。','Hello; we came to view the room for rent.'),('请进。门边有椅子，面前是桌子。','Please come in. There are chairs by the door and the table is in front.'),('洗衣机和热水可以用吗？','May the washing machine and hot water be used?'),('可以，但先问怎么用、什么时候用。','Yes, but first ask how and when to use them.'),('那今天就能搬进来？','Then may we move in today?'),('还没定。先看大小和条件，留下联系方式，明天再说。','Not settled yet. First see the size and conditions, leave contact details, and discuss tomorrow.')],
[('mainidea','What is actually happening?',['A room viewing with details still to confirm','A completed rental and immediate move','A closed hotel visit'],0),('detail','What is by the door?',['Chairs','A river','A washing machine in the doorway'],0),('inference','Does an open gate alone give permission?',['No, they are told to ask first','Yes','Only when carrying a book'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','A room-viewing note','Read the location and state descriptions without assuming an agreement.',[
('朋友坐出租车来，先在院子门口敲门。','My friend arrives by taxi and first knocks at the courtyard entrance.'),('门开着，屋里有人，所以先问。','The gate is open and someone is inside, so the friend asks first.'),('门边有椅子，桌上放着杯子，杯子里没有水。','There are chairs by the door and cups on the table; the cups contain no water.'),('大衣挂着，包放着，书还没有装进去。','The coat is hanging, the bag is set down, and the books have not been packed into it.'),('房间凉快，瓶子倒了，先放好，脏杯垫也先洗。','The room is cool; a bottle has fallen over and should be put properly in place, and the dirty coaster washed.'),('洗衣机在洗手间外面，使用时间还要问。','The washing machine is outside the bathroom; its hours of use still need asking.'),('看住房大小和条件，不是看到开门就已经租好。','Check the dwelling’s size and conditions; seeing an open door does not mean the rental is complete.'),('留下联系方式以后先回酒店，明天再商量。','After leaving contact details, return to the hotel for now and discuss tomorrow.')],
[('mainidea','What distinction matters?',['The room’s current state versus a rental agreement','The courtyard and a confirmed contract are identical','The cups prove permission'],0),('detail','Have the books been packed?',['No','Yes','Only into the washing machine'],0),('inference','Where does the viewer go afterward?',['Back to the hotel','Immediately move into the room','Into the closed shop'],0)],[(1,'开着'),(7,'酒店')]),
text(u,'media','A door that cannot sign','Read an original scene about a physical state and permission.',[
('门开着，是欢迎我吗？','The door is open; is it welcoming me?'),('门不会说话，先问屋里的人。','The door cannot speak; ask the person inside first.'),('桌上放着杯子，给我的吗？','There are cups on the table; are they for me?'),('杯子也没说。问一声吧。','The cups did not say either. Ask first.'),('好，先问，别替门同意。','Okay, ask first; do not consent on the door’s behalf.'),('终于。请进，先看房间。','At last. Please come in and look at the room first.')],
[('inference','What is the joke’s practical point?',['A physical state is not permission','Furniture gives legal consent','The viewer has already rented'],0)],drama=True),
dict(tf=[('租','先看房间，明天再商量租。','View the room first and discuss renting tomorrow.','The rental is complete.',False,'It remains for later discussion.'),('装','书还没有装进包。','The books have not yet been packed into the bag.','The books remain unpacked.',True,'还没有 denies completion.')],reply=[('有人','屋里有人，我能直接进吗？','Someone is in the room; may I just enter?',['先敲门问一声。','有人就是可以。','把椅子洗澡。'],0,'Ask permission first.'),('留下','今天就搬来吗？','Move in today?',['还没定，先留下联系方式。','当然，门开着就是租好了。','杯子已经同意。'],0,'Separate viewing from agreement.')],fill=[('院子','院子门开着，先问一声。','The courtyard gate is open; ask first.'),('椅子','门边有两把椅子。','There are two chairs by the door.')],match=[('头',[('里头有人。','Someone is inside.'),('头发很长。','The hair is long.'),('面前有桌子。','A table is in front.')]),('状态',[('门开着。','The door is open.'),('她开了门。','She opened the door.'),('她拿着书说话。','She talks while holding a book.')])]),
[('Permission before entry','门开着也先问一声。','Ask first even if the door is open.','A physical state does not give consent.'),('A provisional viewing','先看条件，明天再商量。','Check the conditions first and discuss tomorrow.','Do not infer a rental contract.')],
[('门开着。','The door is open.','Ask before entering',['你好，可以进来吗？']),('今天就租好吗？','Is renting settled today?','Keep the agreement provisional',['还没定，明天再商量。'])],
'Native check: existential 是/有/放着, state versus event 了, head suffix tou, 面1 surface sense distinct from flour, room/rental collocations and original object-consent joke. No rental agreement or legal conclusion is claimed.')

